### v1.7.0-wave1 Bug Fix

**BUG: test_instantiation failure (test isolation)** — `TestIntegration.test_instantiation` failed because `ETConsciousAI(name="TestMemory")` loaded a stale state file at the default path (`/root/.et_conscious_ai/memory_state.json`) left by a prior test (`LimbTest`). State loading correctly restored the saved name (`LimbTest`), overriding the constructor argument. **Root cause:** test setup did not use an isolated state path. **Fix:** `setup_method()` now creates a temp directory and passes `state_path=temp_state` to the constructor. **All 167/167 integration tests now pass.**

